  "body": "Viewings by appointment.\r\n\r\nEnjoying an elevated position at the apex of the Orakei peninsula, this substantial property on an 822 sqm (more or less) site zoned Mixed Housing Urban combines family living, city views and exciting future potential.\r\n\r\nSpacious and solid, the home enjoys single level living and fantastic views across to the city from an elevated deck overlooking the swimming pool. Generous open-plan living flows effortlessly outdoors, creating an ideal setting for relaxed family life and entertaining. At the heart of the home, the modern kitchen offers expansive bench space and excellent functionality.\r\n\r\nThree well-proportioned bedrooms include a master with ensuite, while an additional internal room provides valuable flexibility as a guest space, home office or hobby room.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers excellent storage together with a large double garage with direct street access. Outside, the level grounds are neatly landscaped, providing plenty of space around the home and pool.\r\n\r\nZoned for Selwyn College and close to beaches, Orakei Village and Eastridge Shopping Centre, the location delivers an exceptional combination of lifestyle and convenience.\r\n\r\nFor buyers looking to the future, the substantial 822 sq m site also presents exciting development potential in a prime, elevated Orakei position - explore the possibilities or simply enjoy the space and lifestyle on offer today.\r\n\r\nFor more info, call John & Jane 0800 ORAKEI (Note: Photo's taken when the property was owner occupied.)",
